stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> PREP: reason-coded preparation opened against an instance
    PREP --> ACTIVE: operator enters the portal session
    ACTIVE --> WAIT_BLOCKING: waiting on an OTP or an authorised signatory and unable to switch work
    ACTIVE --> WAIT_PARKED: waiting on the tenant and the operator switches to other work
    WAIT_BLOCKING --> ACTIVE: wait clears
    WAIT_PARKED --> ACTIVE: wait clears
    ACTIVE --> EXCEPTION: rejection, error file or hand-back on this instance
    EXCEPTION --> ACTIVE: rework resumes in session
    ACTIVE --> CLOSED: session ends with an outcome recorded
    PREP --> CLOSED: preparation closed without a session, for example a Mode A instance
    CLOSED --> [*]

    note right of WAIT_PARKED
        Parked waits are metered and reported
        but never added to chargeable minutes.
        Only blocking waits enter the meter total.
    end note
